## 5. Kth Missing Positive Number

```python
arr = list(map(int, input("Enter sorted array: ").split()))
k = int(input("Enter k: "))

num = 1
i = 0

while k > 0:
    if i < len(arr) and arr[i] == num:
        i += 1
    else:
        k -= 1
        if k == 0:
            print("Answer =", num)
    num += 1
```
